---
import aboutImage from "../assets/About.svg";
import aboutSide from "../assets/about-image.png";
---

<fieldset
    class="text-center mt-20 border-2 border-gray-700 p-8 md:px-16 textured-background"
>
    <legend class="horror-title text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl"
        >ABOUT</legend
    >
    <div class="about-text-content">
        <img
            class="w-full mb-4 md:w-2/5 md:float-left md:mr-6"
            src={aboutSide.src}
            alt="Abstract background"
        />
        <p class="text-[18px] lg:text-lg mt-8 md:mt-0 mb-6">
            <span
                class="text-red-500 text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold leading-none md:float-left md:mr-2"
                >G</span
            >reetings! I am a Computer Science Graduate from UTSA with
            concentrations in Software Engineering and Data Science. While my
            day-to-day involves resolving technical puzzles as an IT Help Desk
            Technician at University Health, I’ve been fascinated by technology
            and the web from the moment I used my first computer.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[18px] lg:text-lg mb-6">
            I am fluent in technologies like React, TypeScript, and Node.js, and
            I enjoy mastering new tools to build high-performance, accessible
            applications. You’ll notice my work often leans into a 90s analog
            aesthetic—a style inspired by childhood memories of neon lights, VHS
            movies, and the liminal atmosphere of 90s retail spaces.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[18px] lg:text-lg">
            When I’m not creating new experiences, you can find me creating art,
            playing video games, and watching horror movies. All of these fuel
            the creativity and nostalgic energy I bring to my code and design.
        </p>
    </div>
</fieldset>
